{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Mind Ocean to solve a twisted case</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/extras/small_core_loop_600x.gif?t=1745586446\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Mind Diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using experimental technology, you explore Lina's Mind Ocean, fixing her memories to solve an unprecedented missing persons case. Lina's subconscious hides many secrets, critical to unraveling the dark case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Restore broken memories and uncover the past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/extras/hyper-realism-fullHD_2.gif?t=1745586446\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every memory you investigate is missing a key detail. Anything could be the solution. Fill out the correct detail to reveal more of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenging and satisfying deduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every solution is logical, but not obvious. You'll need the right clues to deduce the truth. Listen to private conversations. Inspect small details. Slow down and engage your mind to make the right connections. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A heartbreaking love story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A couple deeply in love have both broken down. Lina is losing her memories and Sebastian has gone missing. A disturbing party seems to cover up something else. And a dark tragedy is buried deep in Lina's mind \u2013 in the part named Guilt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/extras/Actors_optim.gif?t=1745586446\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beautifully executed</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fully voice acted</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique 3D-scan style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Award-winning story and puzzle design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Made by Indoor Sunglasses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/extras/InSun_House_600x.png?t=1745586446\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're a tiny team of curious game devs that love mysteries and discoveries. We wear Indoor Sunglasses so that no one can see us cry. Our games make people ask questions and solve harder problems than they thought possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We met through making the earliest school version of Mind Diver, a detective game based on our heartbreaks. It was nominated as Best Student Game at IGF 2023. We set out to make a grander Mind Diver that could make anyone feel smart and feel seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hopefully we'll get to bring you many more mysterious games in the future.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2259330?t=1745586446","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745586446","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745586446","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745586446","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Use of alcohol, references to depression and mental illness.\r\nSwearing."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Mind Ocean to solve a twisted case</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/extras/small_core_loop_600x.gif?t=1745586446\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Mind Diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using experimental technology, you explore Lina's Mind Ocean, fixing her memories to solve an unprecedented missing persons case. Lina's subconscious hides many secrets, critical to unraveling the dark case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Restore broken memories and uncover the past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/extras/hyper-realism-fullHD_2.gif?t=1745586446\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every memory you investigate is missing a key detail. Anything could be the solution. Fill out the correct detail to reveal more of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenging and satisfying deduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every solution is logical, but not obvious. You'll need the right clues to deduce the truth. Listen to private conversations. Inspect small details. Slow down and engage your mind to make the right connections. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A heartbreaking love story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A couple deeply in love have both broken down. Lina is losing her memories and Sebastian has gone missing. A disturbing party seems to cover up something else. And a dark tragedy is buried deep in Lina's mind \u2013 in the part named Guilt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/extras/Actors_optim.gif?t=1745586446\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beautifully executed</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fully voice acted</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique 3D-scan style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Award-winning story and puzzle design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Made by Indoor Sunglasses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/extras/InSun_House_600x.png?t=1745586446\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're a tiny team of curious game devs that love mysteries and discoveries. We wear Indoor Sunglasses so that no one can see us cry. Our games make people ask questions and solve harder problems than they thought possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We met through making the earliest school version of Mind Diver, a detective game based on our heartbreaks. It was nominated as Best Student Game at IGF 2023. We set out to make a grander Mind Diver that could make anyone feel smart and feel seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hopefully we'll get to bring you many more mysterious games in the future.</p>","developers":["Indoor Sunglasses"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259330/header.jpg?t=1745586446","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Indoor Sunglasses. All Rights Reserved. Licensed to and published by Active Gaming Media Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128712,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128712/movie480.mp4?t=1745576417","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128712/movie_max.mp4?t=1745576417"},"name":"Mind Diver - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic